- decadic/memory/episodic_store.py: backup_to()/restore_from() via SQLite's
  online-backup API (sqlite3.Connection.backup) — safe on a live, open DB and on
  Windows; in-memory store fallback handled.
- decadic/agents/runtime.py: path-explicit save_brain_to/load_brain_from/
  backup_memory_to/restore_memory_from (decoupled from the agent-id filename).
