## 2026-06-15 — Joint-Brace Guidance System

Plan: .cursor/plans/joint-brace_guidance_system_796a1845.plan.md

Goal: replace the external support harness (vertical lift + balance torque +
Standard/Guided modes) with a joint-space orthosis. Every hinge is braced toward
a tuned upright stand pose (q_ref); range of motion starts near-welded (a statue
that cannot fall or drift) and ratchets open per-joint as that joint's
proprioceptive forward-model error falls. Braces are MuJoCo-native joint springs
only -- NO external wrench ever touches the body, so the feet keep 100% of the
weight and the glide is gone by construction.

