## 2026-06-15 — UI-driven Vast.ai GPU deployment (rent / run / watch)

Feature: a new "Deploy / GPU" dashboard tab makes the whole rent-a-GPU flow
terminal-free. Paste a Vast.ai API key once, search for GPUs, click Rent, and the
local server provisions a cloud box, ships the brain + headless MuJoCo body,
runs them on CUDA, opens an ssh tunnel, and reverse-proxies agent traffic so the
existing panels show the REMOTE agent learning live. Stop/Destroy from the UI.

Architecture: local server = control plane + proxy. The dashboard keeps one base
URL; while a deployment is `ready` the server forwards /agents, /agent/* and
/environment* to the tunnelled remote. The proxy middleware is added INNER so the
CORS middleware stays OUTERMOST and owns CORS headers for proxied responses too.

